<h1>The Athletic Benchmarks Behind Every <em>ACL &amp; Achilles Comeback</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 9 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>🏥 Injury Recovery</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">Colts quarterback Daniel Jones says he's "full go" for training camp less than eight months after tearing his Achilles. Across the league, several other key players are working through the same kind of comeback. Here's what actually gets tested before a team clears a player to return — and why "healthy" and "game-ready" aren't the same thing.</p>
</div><div class="content">
<div class="toc">
<div class="toc-label">In This Article</div>
